# Witness: the two image sizes written into each other's place

Swapping them is the likeliest form of this error, because the two numbers sit two lines apart
in one sentence. A set-membership check over both publish logs passes on this input; binding
each figure to the log that records it does not.

The fixtures host publishes and runs as a Native AOT binary of 78,256 bytes, and as a
1,565,592-byte trimmed binary.
